----                             5547  ; Native AmigaOS opForge CLI shell.
----                             5548  ;
----                             5549  ; This first slice mirrors the Rust CLI argument names for a strict native
----                             5550  ; subset and provides deterministic stage stubs until parser/emitter VMs exist
----                             5551  ; on AmigaOS.
